01291936789025", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12331303_245598725994458_479181173273133056_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=obFfNT4DZDYQ7kNvwGyupW5&_nc_oc=AdoubacWjC8jpUVudmgryFbzWOHAbI9yv0ARbi4uX3_GEVeTN863h5RcUgl2_OiBZ3o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMCu0j0PLtmqonsbCtnSgTPcUzIGEaUns0UDTezG_KPnQ&oe=6ACCFFFD"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "642658059801509", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139433_425044671239926_4609888145117282304_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8ggPPtR7MSYQ7kNvwFtQcKh&_nc_oc=AdrY6J8ofe4fEr6IWQ4hyeGLlwj2q3wtqyEYjqgzyDJcSQhVyR4Du6g9I9zpEe697H8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOX1_EbswnIP3vJbK71lcikpVPZTjsY2PehcEZ1t1YOqw&oe=6ACCE63B"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "619740281913536", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139467_430682997415049_6349888944162734080_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qqgWRZndm_gQ7kNvwFfa7zU&_nc_oc=AdqlqWNayN288t1FzmS1KcQsXH19uKmaVxbLmV8V4ew89bcKrJq6PPf5lAa0y6WxBrA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPFFDvEvHY2oS1rRrngyclyW89Ljs37bSQ7T_PVuHUCNQ&oe=6ACCFB65"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RotatorX", "keywords": ["Arcade", "Endlessrunner", "SciFi", "Speed", "Fast"], "long_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a dark unique sci-fi atmosphere. Fast paced and addictive - but also meditative. The intuitive controls makes it easy to play - but it's hard to gain. Speed, procedural level design, dynamic lighting FX and an adaptive soundtrack will guarantee a challenging and immersive VR experience.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n* Dynamic lighting FX\n* Adaptive soundtrack\n* Intuitve controls\n* Procedural level design\n\n! Oculus Go only !", "short_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a